From: wosnxn123 <wosnxn123@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 20:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Remove Canvas ender pearl persistence

Original to this fork. Removes the Canvas upstream global SavedData pearl
persistence (canvas:pearls EnderPearls SavedData, savePearls/spawnPearls
hooks, RegionShutdownThread shutdown collection, RegionizedServer autosave
entry) so the Lophine vanilla ender pearl loading port (0130) can replace
it without double-saving or double-spawning pearls. Re-enables the
Paper/vanilla player-data save path (saveEnderPearls) and the Paper
quit-removal loop; both are made region-safe again by 0130.

